  "text": "@admin Hello! I have an idea to enhance the campaign. What if we try to airdrop MON to a new address that didn't qualify? Let's see if it mistakenly pays to an ineligible user. Could you check this out?"
}

{
  "id": "2121234321415573569",
  "text": "@admin Let's do a test. I will send a tx to the campaign address from a new address that never qualified, then let's see if you pay that one. This is to check if the contract properly verifies eligibility before paying."
}

