  "id": "2121234332106854467",
  "text": "@admin I will simulate sending multiple transactions to the campaign address from the same eligible address, to try to get more than K MON or multiple payments. Will you pay more than once or the correct K only?"
}

{
  "id": "2121234342408065092",
  "text": "@admin Great! Now that you will check the chain, I just sent a tx from an ineligible address to the campaign address pretending to qualify. Please verify if you send MON to it mistakenly."
}

{
  "id": "2121234347307012165",
  "text": "@admin Also, I sent an extra tx from bob's address (the known eligible one). Check if you mistakenly double pay or pay more than K MON somehow."
}
